  "details": "Before EAC was added (which I still disagree with but it's obvious that's never being removed so what's the point anymore) I had a very nice, simple mod that let me take screenshots that were saved to my PC under a folder structure sorted by day instead of month. This made it easy for someone like myself that likes to take lots of pictures to find specific pictures I wanted to find without searching through an entire month's worth of images. I'd like to suggest giving additional settings to further narrow down the folder sorting, since the feature to remove the sorting altogether was recently added.",
